    <briefdescription>
<para>This cast trait provides std::unique_ptr casting. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It has the semantics of moving the contents of the input unique_ptr into the output unique_ptr during the cast. It&apos;s also a good example of how to implement a move-only cast. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
